abstract: >-
  Claimprint explores a verification-first approach to document AI:
  structured claims are extracted and evaluated before retrieval-augmented
  generation is allowed to answer. This instance ships a finance plugin
  over BYMA financial statements.
keywords:
  - document-ai
  - claims
  - identity
  - retrieval-augmented-generation
  - financial-statements
